values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "你是一个视频提示词专家，按照我的这个格式解析下这个视频。只写提示词。分别生成中英两个版本。\n\n\n0-2秒：初始构图与氛围建立 采用中景（Medium Shot）开场，主体呈现强烈的2.5D超写实动漫（Hyper-realistic Anime）风格。少女通过灵动的猫爪手势建立第一人称交互感。此时画面侧重于展现复杂的服装纹理与发丝物理模拟（Hair Physics），背景采用纯黑深空，营造出高精细度的CG大师作质感。\n\n2-5秒：线性推进与质感显现 镜头执行平稳的推进（Push-in）。随着距离拉近，光影重心转向皮肤的**次表面散射（SSS）效果，呈现出通透、柔和的肉感。三点式布光中的轮廓光（Rim Light）**勾勒出浅色发丝的边缘，将主体从黑暗中完美剥离，展现出电影级的空间深度。\n\n5-8秒：极近特写与视觉冲击 镜头最终锁定在面部特写（Close-up）。触发极浅景深（Shallow DoF），使角色耳后的饰品进入自然虚化状态。重点聚焦于深蓝色的**异色瞳（Piercing Eyes）与精致的睫毛细节。整体风格在这一阶段达到顶点，融合了柔焦（Soft Focus）**美学与工业级渲染的锐利度，极具视觉张力。\n\n风格关键词： * 视觉流派： 超写实动漫（Hyper-realistic Anime）、大师作（Masterpiece）。\n\n光影氛围： 轮廓光（Rim Light）、高对比度（High Contrast）、柔焦（Soft Focus）。", "这是一个5秒的视频", 0.6, 1355395280, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "link": 61, "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 57, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name":