p Light）勾勒出面部疲态。整体画面定格在一种充满生活重压的电影级写实感中。\n\n风格关键词： 写实主义（Realism）、电影感（Cinematic）、纪实风格（Documentary Style）。\n\n光影氛围： 昏暗顶光（Dim Overhead Light）、冷调阴影（Cool Shadows）、高对比度（High Contrast）。\n\n***\n\n**English Version**\n\n0-2s: Initial Composition & Atmosphere Opens with a Medium Shot in a realistic style. A girl in a pink dress struggles to carry a heavy, sticker-covered suitcase up a dim, dilapidated concrete staircase. A cool overhead light creates an oppressive, gritty atmosphere.\n\n2-4s: Action Progression & Detail The camera remains steady. She reaches the landing and drops the luggage. The focus is on the physical exertion and the heavy, realistic texture of the movement.\n\n4-6s: Emotional Hold & Focus Visual weight shifts to her expression. She wipes sweat from her forehead. The Top Light highlights her fatigue, capturing a cinematic, slice-of-life moment of exhaustion.\n\nStyle Keywords: Realism, Cinematic, Documentary Style.\n\nLighting & Atmosphere: Dim Overhead Light, Cool Shadows, High Contrast."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 3, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.0", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {"视频信息": {"external": [[8, 0, "STRING"]], "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [210, 194.5454559326172], "pos": [-1050, 0], "widgets_values": ["这是一个10秒的视频"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "index": 0, "id": -1, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "orde